By the way, the one thing I want to achieve with this poll is to speed up
change in BPFK Lojban which, at this point, in more frozen than during the
freeze. If the results will be treated with an 'Oh, OK,' and not with some
actual, motivated change, I don't want to organize them in the first place.

So, if a new poll like this is up, and it reaches the dark corners of the
jboce'u, I'd like someone with enough decisive power to treat the results
seriously and adapt to the results (not the other way).

If I establish that, I can start asking around as said before, and act.

